/P 321 0 R
/T (The Computer Science & Engineering Department at IIT Kanpur is the first department in India to start Computer Science education. The department started in August 1963 with an IBM 1620 system--a novelty then, even in many North American and European universities. )
/E (The Computer Science & Engineering Department at IIT Kanpur is the first department in India to start Computer Science education. The department started in August 1963 with an IBM 1620 system--a novelty then, even in many North American and European universities. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
