/S /H2
/P 321 0 R
/T (Today, many of the nation's leading experts, educationists, and consultants in computer science are alumni of this department. Currently, the department has a faculty of 33 whose interests span almost all areas of computer science. )
/E (Today, many of the nation's leading experts, educationists, and consultants in computer science are alumni of this department. Currently, the department has a faculty of 33 whose interests span almost all areas of computer science. )
/Pg 12 0 R
