/Title (The Computer Science & Engineering Department at IIT Kanpur is the first department in India to start Computer Science education. The department started in August 1963 with an IBM 1620 system--a novelty then, even in many North American and European universities.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2150 0 R
/Next 2417 0 R
>>
endobj
2287 0 obj
<<
/Title (The department runs BTech, MTech, MS\(R\), and Ph.D. programs and is known for its academic rigor, excellence, and cutting-edge research with several sponsored projects and consultancies. Some students convert their B.Tech. program into a dual degree program, which results in students getting both a B.Tech and an M.Tech. degree at the end of 5 years. The department has also started the M.S. program, which is uniquely tailored for deep domain expertise, combining intensive thesis-driven research with high-impact software systems development. MS graduates bring specialised problem-solving skills, production-grade engineering experience, and advanced academic rigour to core industry roles.")
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2150 0 R
/Prev 2417 0 R
>>
